  "title": "dumpcap: Count custom blocks as data blocks (packets)",
  "description": "wiretap/pcapng.c get_block_type_internal always treats Custom Blocks\nas data blocks (non internal, i.e. records), so have dumpcap do the same.\n\nAdd some comments about how block types registered through wiretap\nplugins can't be treated consistently.\n\nNote that Sysdig blocks are now registered like plugins in wiretap\n(commit 6d781658247a27f330c40beccf80f21478927623), but are still\nhardcoded here (see commit se6d781658247a27f330c40beccf80f21478927623.)\n\nFix #17981",
